  "summary": {
    "zh": "2.4 GHz带屏控无人机，配光流定位、双摄、三面红外避障和360°翻滚。",
    "en": "A 2.4 GHz screen-controller drone with optical flow, dual cameras, three-direction infrared sensing and 360° rolls."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "2.4 GHz带屏控无人机，配光流定位、双摄、三面红外避障和360°翻滚。",
      "资料列有三面红外避障、光流定点、高度保持、无头模式和六轴陀螺仪，控制器支持四通道飞行和360°翻滚。",
      "套装含无人机、遥控器、电池、USB线、两片桨叶、螺丝刀和说明书，展开尺寸30.6 × 24 × 6 cm。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "A 2.4 GHz screen-controller drone with optical flow, dual cameras, three-direction infrared sensing and 360° rolls.",
      "The source lists three-direction infrared sensing, optical-flow positioning, altitude hold, headless mode and a six-axis gyroscope.",
      "The set includes the drone, controller, battery, USB cable, two propellers, a screwdriver and manuals."
    ]
  },
